<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <h1>Account &amp; Data Deletion</h1>
    <p class="meta">Carnevale Companion app &middot; operated by Anachrion &middot; Last updated 25 July 2026</p>

    <p>
      This page explains how to request deletion of your <strong>Carnevale Companion</strong> account
      and the data associated with it. Carnevale Companion is an unofficial companion app for the
      Carnevale tabletop miniatures game, operated by <strong>Anachrion</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2>How to request deletion</h2>
    <p>To delete your account and its data, send an email to:</p>
    <div class="callout">
      <strong><a href="mailto:contact@carnevale-app.com?subject=Account%20deletion%20request">contact@carnevale-app.com</a></strong>
      <br>with the subject line <em>&ldquo;Account deletion request&rdquo;</em>.
    </div>
    <p>So we can locate and verify your account, please send the request <strong>from the email address
      you registered with</strong>, and include your <strong>username</strong> if you know it. We do not
      ask for your password. Once we have confirmed the request comes from the account owner, your data
      is deleted within <strong>30 days</strong>, and we email you to confirm once it is done.</p>

    <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
    <p>When your account is deleted, we permanently remove:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>your account details — email address, username, and the stored (hashed) password;</li>
      <li>all content you created — your gang lists, rosters, and game/encounter data;</li>
      <li>your authentication and session tokens.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What may be retained, and for how long</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Short-term technical logs</strong> (e.g. server request/error logs that may include an
        IP address) are kept only for a brief period for security and troubleshooting, and are then
        purged automatically. They are not used to re-identify you after deletion.</li>
      <li>We retain no other personal data once deletion is complete. We do not sell or share your data
        with third parties, and the app uses no advertising or analytics.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about deletion or your data: <a href="mailto:contact@carnevale-app.com">contact@carnevale-app.com</a>.
      See also our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <footer>
      Carnevale is a trademark of its respective owner. This companion app is an unofficial,
      fan-made tool and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the publisher of the game.
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
